  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Biomedical Spin-off Cameroon</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical-commercial synergy for the diffusion of portable radiological systems in Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Attivazione di una struttura permanente a Douala e Yaound&#xe8;, intensificare il rapporto con universit&#xe0; con corsi di ingegneria biomedica, con tutte le strutture ospedaliere presenti in Camerun, per presentare attrezzature attualmente non reperibili nel Paese (come ad esempio gli apparecchi radiologici portatili)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Setup a permanent structure in Douala and Yaound&#xe8;, intensify the relationship with universities with biomedical engineering courses, with all the hospitals present in Cameroon, in order to introduce equipments currently not available in the country (such as portable radiological equipment)</narrative>
  </description>
